            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kicorakini kotoma Ejakait Yesu Kristo, kikwenyari da luikote nen ebe, kiswamata kaiyapaara, konyamata ikecenyamat kikulepek. ",
